#: templates/timeline_form.html.twig
msgid "Protect sensitive information"
msgstr "Protéger les informations sensibles"

#: templates/timeline_form.html.twig
msgid ""
"The value is encrypted and never added to the ticket timeline or "
"notifications."
msgstr ""
"La valeur est chiffrée et n’est jamais ajoutée à la chronologie du ticket ni "
"aux notifications."

